flowchart LR
  accTitle: Proposed evidence model
  accDescr: Tasks link many recordings, agent runs and pull requests. Usage belongs to its reported scope, corrections preserve originals, and findings cite evidence. Links carry explicit or inferred provenance.
  Project["📁 Project<br/>stable repo identity"] --> Task["Task<br/>user intent"]
  Task --> Links["Versioned associations<br/>explicit or inferred<br/>confidence + correction"]
  Recording["⏱ Recording<br/>authorized intervals + gaps"] --> Links
  Run["Agent run / thread<br/>turns + parent links"] --> Links
  PR["GitHub PR<br/>repo ID + PR number"] --> Links
  Recording --> App["App observations<br/>not task identity"]
  Run --> Config["Model / native effort<br/>per reported scope"]
  Run --> Usage["Usage observations<br/>delta or cumulative<br/>source + coverage"]
  PR --> Review["Review / CI / commits<br/>provider IDs + revision"]
  Links --> Sources["Evidence references"]
  App --> Sources
  Config --> Sources
  Usage --> Sources
  Review --> Sources
  Correction["✎ Append-only correction<br/>target + author + reason"] --> Sources
  Sources --> Finding["User-facing finding<br/>claim + sources + uncertainty"]
  Finding --> Memory["Optional derived memory<br/>rebuildable and replaceable"]
  classDef proposed fill:#FFF0D1,stroke:#8D5D11,stroke-width:2px,color:#493005
  classDef evidence fill:#DCECFB,stroke:#285B85,stroke-width:2px,color:#173B58
  class Project,Task,Links,Config,Usage,PR,Review,Correction,Finding,Memory proposed
  class Recording,Run,App,Sources evidence
